---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import CtaBand from '../components/CtaBand.astro';
import { Image } from 'astro:assets';
import { Heart, Leaf, Users } from '@lucide/astro';

import portraitImage from '../assets/images/imgi_15_689d13e9d232a380bb17ff2c.jpg';
import familyImage from '../assets/images/imgi_9_689ec57c5bdfcf6800cf5529.jpg';
import birthImage from '../assets/images/imgi_11_689cede83b01e6b095436d26.jpg';

const values = [
  {
    icon: Heart,
    title: 'Faith-Centered',
    description:
      'Rooted in trust and gentle encouragement, never fear-mongering, never high-pressure.',
  },
  {
    icon: Leaf,
    title: 'Genuinely Holistic',
    description:
      'From holistic fertility through the fourth trimester, in one connected journey.',
  },
  {
    icon: Users,
    title: 'Community First',
    description:
      'You are never left to figure this out alone, in the course or in the community.',
  },
];
---

<BaseLayout
  title="About Hailey"
  description="Meet Hailey Aliff, a second-generation midwife and mother of four, and the story behind Joy Within Birth."
>
  <section class="mx-auto max-w-6xl px-6 pb-16 pt-14 sm:pt-20">
    <div class="grid items-center gap-12 md:grid-cols-2">
      <div>
        <p class="text-sm font-semibold uppercase tracking-wide text-sage-600">About Hailey</p>
        <h1 class="mt-4 text-balance text-4xl leading-[1.1] sm:text-5xl">
          Second-generation midwife. Mother of four. Your guide through this season.
        </h1>
        <p class="mt-5 max-w-lg text-lg leading-relaxed text-ink-500">
          Hailey Aliff built Joy Within Birth to be the trusted, faith-centered guide she
          wished every mama had beside her, one that honors both evidence and intuition,
          both careful preparation and quiet peace.
        </p>
      </div>
      <div class="relative overflow-hidden rounded-3xl shadow-lift">
        <Image
          src={portraitImage}
          alt="A mother smiling warmly at her sleeping newborn in a cozy home setting"
          class="h-full w-full object-cover"
          style="transform: scale(1.04);"
          data-scroll-scale-image
          widths={[480, 768, 1024]}
          sizes="(min-width: 768px) 45vw, 100vw"
          priority
        />
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="mx-auto max-w-3xl px-6 py-10">
    <div class="space-y-6 text-lg leading-relaxed text-ink-600">
      <p>
        I still remember the first time I sat with a mama who was six months pregnant,
        hands trembling, telling me she was terrified she'd &ldquo;freeze up&rdquo; when
        it mattered most. She'd read everything. Watched every video. And still felt like
        she was standing at the edge of the unknown, alone.
      </p>
      <p>
        I understand that feeling deeply, because I've stood there myself. As a
        second-generation midwife, I grew up watching my own mother hold space for
        laboring women with a calm that felt almost supernatural. And still, when it was
        my turn, fear tried to find me too. One of my own births was completely
        pain-free, not because fear never knocked, but because I had learned how to
        answer the door with peace instead of panic.
      </p>
      <p>That's the heart of Joy Within Birth.</p>
      <p>
        This isn't another generic hospital class that rushes through paperwork and
        parking instructions. It's nine modules and over ten hours of training built to
        walk with you, step by step, through nourishing your body, steadying your mind,
        planning your birth with clarity, preparing your partner to truly support you,
        and even holding space for the fourth trimester that follows.
      </p>
      <p>
        You don't need previous experience. You don't need to have it all figured out.
        You just need a trusted place to begin, and a community of women walking this
        same sacred road beside you.
      </p>
      <p>
        I believe birth was never meant to be walked alone, and it was never meant to be
        ruled by fear. With the right preparation, you can move from anxious uncertainty
        into calm, grounded confidence, the kind that stays with you long after your baby
        arrives.
      </p>
      <p class="font-medium text-ink-800">
        If you're ready to trade fear for peace, I'd be honored to walk this season with
        you. &mdash; Hailey
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="bg-cream-100 py-16">
    <div class="mx-auto max-w-6xl px-6">
      <div class="mx-auto max-w-2xl text-center">
        <h2 class="text-balance text-3xl sm:text-4xl">What Joy Within Birth stands on</h2>
      </div>
      <div class="mt-12 grid gap-8 sm:grid-cols-3">
        {values.map(({ icon: Icon, title, description }) => (
          <div class="rounded-2xl bg-cream-50 p-6 text-center shadow-soft ring-1 ring-ink-100/60">
            <Icon class="mx-auto h-7 w-7 text-blush-500" />
            <h3 class="mt-4 text-lg font-semibold text-ink-900">{title}</h3>
            <p class="mt-2 text-sm leading-relaxed text-ink-500">{description}</p>
          </div>
        ))}
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="mx-auto max-w-6xl px-6 py-20">
    <div class="grid gap-6 sm:grid-cols-2">
      <div class="relative aspect-[4/3] overflow-hidden rounded-2xl shadow-soft">
        <Image
          src={familyImage}
          alt="A family sitting closely together, holding their newborn baby"
          class="h-full w-full object-cover"
          widths={[480, 640]}
          sizes="(min-width: 640px) 45vw, 100vw"
        />
      </div>
      <div class="relative aspect-[4/3] overflow-hidden rounded-2xl shadow-soft">
        <Image
          src={birthImage}
          alt="A partner gently supporting a laboring mother during a home water birth"
          class="h-full w-full object-cover"
          widths={[480, 640]}
          sizes="(min-width: 640px) 45vw, 100vw"
        />
      </div>
    </div>
    <p class="mx-auto mt-8 max-w-2xl text-balance text-center text-ink-500">
      Whether your birth happens in a hospital room or a birthing tub at home, Joy Within
      Birth was built to walk with you, and the person beside you, through all of it.
    </p>
  </section>

  <CtaBand
    heading="I'd be honored to walk this season with you"
    subheading="Enroll in Joy Within Birth and gain lifetime access to the course, the community, and Hailey herself."
  />
</BaseLayout>
